OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain in the
OL,6,Fevening, clearing Orkney by around
OL,7,Fmidnight, and Shetland in the early
OL,8,Fhours. Severe gales for Orkney at
OL,9,Ffirst, gradually easing. Gales for
OL,10,FShetland for a time.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FBright spells and a few
OL,13,Fshowers in the morning and wind easing
OL,14,Fdown. Strong winds, showery rain
OL,15,Freturn through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
